<title>PERU: TABLE -Peru's Buenaventura 6-mo net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE -Peru's Buenaventura 6-mo net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 79.9 million soles vs 44.3 million soles.</p>
<p>Revs - 78.3 million soles vs 99.2 million soles.</p>
<p>NOTES: Compania de Minas Buenaventura SA is a Peruvian polymetal miner and Lima Stock Exchange blue-chip.</p>
